# Firmware binary name

After every ESP32 firmware build, copy the image to the project root with the version in the file name. Do not leave the user with only `.pio\build\esp32dev\firmware.bin`.

- Read `FW_VERSION` in `src/main.cpp`.
- Output file: `e25aer_gnss_<FW_VERSION>.bin` in the ESP32 project root.
- Example: version `1.2.5` becomes `e25aer_gnss_1.2.5.bin`.
- Tell the user that full path when the build is done.
